    IsAnalyticNear X x → GermIrreducibleAt X x →
    (∃ W ∈ 𝓝 x, ∀ x' ∈ X ∩ W, A x' = A x → x' = x) →
    (∀ h : (Fin d → ℂ) → ℂ, AnalyticAt ℂ h (A x) → (∀ᶠ z in 𝓝 x, z ∈ X → h (A z) = 0) →
        ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 (A x), h y = 0) →
